<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57983" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλοῖστρον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῷστρον</span></b> , τό, prob. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλεῖστρον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλοιτοιμωγεῖς:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκουσταὶ θρήνου</span>, Id. (fort.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλύετ᾽ οἰμωγῆς: ἀκούετε
			θρήνου</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλοιώτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <i>wearing a collar</i>, hence, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσμώτης</span>
			, Id.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλοιωτός</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			Id.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
